---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about Engage As You Age — the preeminent senior social interaction service in Northern California, founded by Ben Lewis in 2009."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">About Us</h1>

    <div class="prose-content mt-8">
      <p>
        Engage As You Age is the preeminent social interaction service provider in Northern California.
        For over a decade, we have been dedicated to facilitating social engagement and lifelong learning
        for elderly individuals. Our social visits are designed to stimulate and enhance cognitive and
        social interactions, while also providing much-needed respite for family caregivers.
      </p>

      <p>
        Founded in 2009 in San Francisco, we have paired thousands of seniors with smart, empathetic
        specialists who share their interests and passions — with a particular focus on those living with
        dementia, Alzheimer's, or physical or cognitive limitations.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Founder — Ben Lewis</h2>
      <p>
        Ben Lewis is an expert on aging in place and family connectivity technologies. His background
        includes teaching and volunteer work internationally, as well as roles in education,
        telecommunications, and the internet industry. He holds a summa cum laude degree from Washington
        University and an MA in History from Yale University.
      </p>
      <p>
        Ben personally meets with all families and conducts final interviews for staff, ensuring every
        match is made with care and intention.
      </p>

      <h2>Press</h2>
      <p>
        Engage As You Age has been featured in the <em>San Francisco Chronicle</em>, CBS 5, the{' '}
        <em>Marin Independent Journal</em>, and the <em>Jewish Weekly of Northern California</em>,
        recognized for helping keep seniors intellectually stimulated and socially connected.
      </p>

      <h2>Join Our Team</h2>
      <p>
        We're always looking for thoughtful, engaged individuals to join our team of Activity Specialists.
        If you're passionate about making a difference in the lives of seniors,{' '}
        <a href="/work-for-us">learn more about working with us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
